1- Product scope description
We will make an educational game to teach history by making the players simulate the historic eras and experince the life back then.
First a demo version of the game will be released to the public.
In the demo version players will experince lives in (Ancient Egypt & American revolution) but in full game we'll provide all the other eras.
Main functions will be providing quizzes to test knowledge and side quests for even more lively experince.
There also be level-up system to unlock more eras.
Also multiplayer will be featured to keep some gaming taste in the game.

2- Product acceptence criteria
We decided to make the game run on IOS and android and possibly on VR too in the future(not confirmed yet).
When offline players will only play the historic eras (story mode) however with internet connection they will also access the multiplayer (competitve mode).
To ensure our players to experince the most accurate results , before release the game will be reviewed by Antiquities Authority and Minister of Tourism.

3- Project delivers
An EDUCATIONAL entertaining game about history to make students love history again.
Our servers will provide global leaderboards based on how much knowledge players have gained from the game.

4- Project exclusions
As known about the human nature and its crulity , some parts won't be suitable for kids to watch nor experince so we will try to make the events less tragic
and violent and keep the accuracy of the events as much as possible.
(There are some discussions to make a safe mode made especially for kids to play)

5- Project constrains
All laptops and computers involved must be dell or hp as mentioned.
Project must be done after 3 years.

6- Project assumptions
There are really no assumptions except for kids might try the game so we might add a safe mode made for them.
Other than that there are no assumptions.
